-- action_resolver.lua
-- Challenge Action Resolution for Majesty
-- Ticket S4.4: Maps suits to mechanical effects
--
-- Suits and their actions:
-- - SWORDS: Melee (requires engagement), Missile (bypasses engagement), Aim
-- - PENTACLES: Roughhouse (Trip, Disarm, Displace)
-- - CUPS: Support, healing, social
-- - WANDS: Banter (attacks Morale), magic
--
-- Tests of Fate carry the rulebook Great Success procedure. Ordinary Challenge
-- Actions use their action and weapon rules directly.

